{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_036kan0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_036kan0104_2001_036kan", "source_sha256": "eb190f98efe7b16e329c8a72c2db23eb79e161afb74b23b37625be6435fbec98", "ja": "やったぁ！　えへっ♪\n……って、ああっ！？", "zh": "太好了！嘿嘿♪\n……等等，啊！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_036kan0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_036kan0104_2002_036kan", "source_sha256": "923880bfd328823f92928da6bb732453ecb0fdd7eba32e776949b6e9be5fd2e0", "ja": "すみません、{$P$}さん！\n今の歌、やっぱり忘れてください～！", "zh": "对不起，{$P$}先生！\n我刚刚唱的歌，还是请你忘记吧～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_036kan0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_036kan0104_2003_p", "source_sha256": "7b7ee65d56757a05c660a14dad3711d2cc12801777370a134fbcd3c43269588d", "ja": "いや、インパクトがありすぎて無理だと思うけど……。\n今の歌が、どうかしたのか？", "zh": "这个，冲击实在太强大，我恐怕忘不了……\n刚才的歌怎么了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_036kan0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_036kan0104_2004_036kan", "source_sha256": "5c6584400cfef91c0ac314dc5310f30eaa70ccd522297d82dc98ff794767a986", "ja": "だってだって、私のこの衣装、\n志保ちゃんとおそろいっぽいじゃないですか！", "zh": "因为因为，我的这套服装，\n不是和志保的服装成套吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_036kan0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_036kan0104_2005_036kan", "source_sha256": "fdbb92b9fa4b4c3bd5e6a2ea3028d22eb6642987969ce9f274e0107bad7c6534", "ja": "衣装はおそろいだし、公演でも一緒に歌うし！\nだから今回は、志保ちゃんみたいに……。", "zh": "不只服装是成套的，还要在公演上一起唱歌！\n所以这一次，我要像志保一样……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_036kan0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_036kan0104_2006_036kan", "source_sha256": "84d72dcef10b171508f3b6dc02d90ffaf8a3d68769a5c9a50b7f519cf9e75862", "ja": "「カッコよく、クールな可奈でいこう！」って\n思ってたんです。ううっ、それなのに～……！", "zh": "我原本是打算「拿出可奈又帅又酷的一面！」的。\n呜呜，可是……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_036kan0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_036kan0104_2007_p", "source_sha256": "2e046d0606dd82fc4b4e98a782b5b5c195dad4ae68350504fa701ef521e8767a", "ja": "そういう事か。\n確かに、クールな感じはしなかったかな……。", "zh": "原来如此。\n的确没什么酷帅的感觉呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_036kan0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_036kan0104_2008_036kan", "source_sha256": "a490835dd5cd3e3dd0e63b1f8748064f8e93bd0fba2237a547ebf38a5471c3c2", "ja": "せっかく志保ちゃんと歌うんだから、\nちゃんとしなきゃなー♪　矢吹きゃなー♪", "zh": "难得有机会和志保一起唱歌，\n我要振作点才行～♪矢吹可奈才行～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_036kan0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_036kan0104_2009_p", "source_sha256": "d206826453190e959d489123a222c2097e53784e03c2a6948e33cc12edd2d878", "ja": "可奈は志保と歌うのが、本当に楽しみなんだな。\nでも、無理に合わせることはないんじゃないか？", "zh": "可奈，看来你真的很期待和志保合唱呢。\n不过，你不需要勉强自己配合她吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_036kan0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_036kan0104_2010_036kan", "source_sha256": "4e25ab88fd202b21bbd5de4988c13c46542ba6dd73a061f7915a8b0009486ae8", "ja": "えーっ！　でもでも、\nふたりの息がぴったりじゃないと、ですよね？", "zh": "什么──！？可是可是，\n我们两个要很有默契才行，不是吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_036kan0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_036kan0104_2011_p", "source_sha256": "1d3a96dca667da12f351e2441fd5f94d6c07474085b1f7a601110270eb79237c", "ja": "確かに、相手を尊重するのは大切だけど。\nそれはお互いさまだよ。", "zh": "尊重对方确实很重要，\n但这点对双方来说都一样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_036kan0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_036kan0104_2012_p", "source_sha256": "cd7327dcbdac37fdadbb4bf63435b3c714b6b9c53a6fc5b27bd8d2dd66fcfa31", "ja": "可奈のいいところは志保もわかってると思うし、\n尊重したいと思ってるんじゃないかな。", "zh": "我想志保一定很清楚可奈的优点在哪里，\n她应该也会尊重你的特色吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_036kan0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_036kan0104_2013_036kan", "source_sha256": "3c630e1d00886e00b4fca784a95947850c4de7b1a8b951c41bd3a3da4a287a0c", "ja": "えっ、志保ちゃんが私のいいところを？\nでもでも私、怒られてばっかりのような……。", "zh": "什么？志保知道我的优点？\n可是可是，我一天到晚挨她骂耶……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_036kan0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_036kan0104_2014_036kan", "source_sha256": "1e07d4ecd7ecbcb2dce9136f2e2114ec68fb39a9c3dee5906fb92415c605ca27", "ja": "私のいいところって、どんなところですか？\n{$P$}さん、教えてくださいっ！", "zh": "我的优点是什么呢？\n{$P$}先生，请你告诉我！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
