{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_036kan0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_036kan0104_2016_036kan", "source_sha256": "ff3db3c3bfee5dbc2c778c178b83f20fbb52cfacb47e381aa669fae28c907f8a", "ja": "本当ですか！？　えへへ……♪\n志保ちゃんにほめられちゃいました！", "zh": "真的吗！？嘿嘿……♪\n志保称赞我了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_036kan0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_036kan0104_2017_p", "source_sha256": "6f6356f6b55ec7dc45380093f486f8ae56efb965ee38b7ade3429e3bfa64893c", "ja": "いや、俺は志保じゃないけど……。\nでも、志保もそう思ってるんじゃないかな。", "zh": "等等，我不是志保啊……\n不过，志保应该也是这么想的吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_036kan0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_036kan0104_2018_036kan", "source_sha256": "153bdf85bf55ff73aa8740a642f37b4e16547b89a75de739246de0d8f98b830c", "ja": "{$P$}さん、私、なんだかすっごく\n元気がわいてきました！　ありがとうございます！", "zh": "{$P$}先生，\n我感觉充满活力了！谢谢你！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_036kan0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_036kan0104_2019_036kan", "source_sha256": "a62c786a5977198d193b1c686fd4b8909fd4cc8c301d846e47035e434bdbc8ce", "ja": "志保ちゃんと～デュエット～♪\n絶対に～絶対に～、成功させるぞっと～♪", "zh": "和志保～二重唱～♪\n绝对～绝对～要成功喔～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
